[00:45.134] In this polythene town
[00:52.934] We can't put pellets down
[01:00.946] On these heaps of waste
[01:08.396] As if it can't be traced
[01:32.283] Now the temperature draws on
[01:36.441] But will it melt the things we've thrown?
[01:40.270] Ignoring for so long
[01:44.200] Expanding this polythene town
[01:46.890]
[01:47.979] Now no one can slow down
[01:51.857] Yeah there is nothing we can't solve
[01:55.813] Until it goes down
[01:59.710] Until we vanish, quiet and blue
[02:02.746] It rains in plastic, we're remaining still
[02:12.982] Trampled roads all paved with what we spilled.
[02:21.043]
